{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9TY2Ftc2dpdmluZyUyMCUyODIwMjMlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Scamsgiving","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/m55hAuFjEY3OTZscPKHzEjwgIsk.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jtou0GkNEMXaiubn5dSM1BjUG82.jpg","description":"Jason and his mother, Yun, make big bucks together in Chinatown swindling money out of people since Jason was little. Along with the grocery store owner Andy who took them in since Jason was a baby, they decide to do one last big job. Their target is Mrs. Apple, the founder of Tao Lin, a world renowned porcelain company. Jason pretends to be that rich old granny's long lost grandson, and Mrs. Apple insists on bringing Jason back to Taiwan, so that Jason can officially reclaim his heritage. In Mrs. Apple's extravagant house, these foreigners start role-playing to infiltrate the Zong Family. Jason starts to feel the warmth of being a part of a family that he has never felt before. This has greatly affected Team America's plan, the three of them start to blame and fight each other. Their cover is about to be exposed, but somehow the truth of Jason's family mystery is revealed..\n\nReleased 20 Jan 2023 · Taiwan · Language: Chinese\nStudio: Green Film Productions\n\nOn your server — Audio: Chinese · Subtitle files: English","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Family","Drama","Others"],"imdbRating":"6.0","cast":["Grace Chen Shu-Fang","Sonia Sui","Edward Chen","Tai Chih-yuan","Lin Chih-ju","Cherry Hsieh","Phoebe Lin","Hans Chung"],"director":["Yeh Tien-lun"],"released":"2023-01-20T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Yeh Tien-lun","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zURLvsxizVHxU6BWEaQ0jLYoKw8.jpg"},{"name":"Grace Chen Shu-Fang","character":"Mrs. Apple","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/b6HFWVa7UwexYgFIXGmTnPdiYcz.jpg"},{"name":"Sonia Sui","character":"Yun Wang","photo":"https://image.tmdb.o